      "category": "interaction",
      "traits": [
        "mental",
        "primal"
      ],
      "text": "Adrivallo's wineskin magically enchants any alcohol inside.\n\nWith an Interact action, a living creature can imbibe the alcohol and gain a +1 item bonus to Will saves and a +3 item bonus to Will saves against fear effects for the following hour. When the wineskin is removed from a satyr's person, the magic remains only until the wine spoils. The wineskin holds up to eight drafts of wine.\n\nEffect: Sylvan Wine"
    },
